{
  "name": "@dsh-external/dsh-opencode-quota",
  "version": "0.5.3",
  "description": "OpenCode GO 套餐额度小组件：侧边栏设置按钮上方显示滚动/周/月三档额度用量（百分比 + 24时制更新时间）+ 官方账单（今日/本月分块、各模型柱状条，getCosts RPC）。一键刷新全部（force 跳过缓存），账单 RPC 自动重试抗网络抖动。凭据不出服务器。",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/index.js",
    "lib/client.js",
    "bin/modlens-wrap.cmd",
    "bin/modlens-append.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "MIT"
}
